{"v":4,"catch":"您能熬過這場危機嗎？","desc":"Zombie Dash 是一款激烈的動作遊戲，故事背景設定在一個被成群的嗜血殭屍佔領的末日世界。作為最後的倖存者之一，你必須穿過黑暗、廢棄的街道，搜尋補給，並擊退一波又一波的亡靈襲擊。由於資源有限且緊張局勢加劇，每一個決定都可能意味著生與死的差異。您能接受挑戰並成為人類的最後希望嗎？","publisher":"Gametry","release":"2025-02-20","genres":["街機","動作","射擊"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["英文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.9GB / Switch 0.9GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/071d674400232d1d70ac609dfba93840c184ea65ce8c2f12caedcedf0da041f7.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/d2ab15213e01b72aad9d2fa9ddb77323585352d23dd3f6308e0986c5d476e44e.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/be9f493821fa7c34d4f7834339e595b26afef78d4cd4a5cbd4197a772ff602da.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/9015445da524ff894c06cdd4f4dc607688cca5bfd47a69f81c7d55bb640636aa.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/f8678279ed05e86d4113a95aa1275584b67c0ea8601ea8ee512cccf42754fdd0.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/a93625d31c1f963ac6c5f0a9f5726db838d82e3f63c812bbb6ae4687bc8b6e1b.jpg"],"titleId":"0100dc5021bec000","dlc":[]}